internal/core/cli.c
-------------------

PHP's command line on Cairo (`cairo php`: the "cli" sapi_module_struct and
its output, header, variable and logging callbacks, the constants STDIN,
STDOUT and STDERR in cli_register_file_handles, and the order in which a
script is opened, run or checked in cli_request and cli_run) is adapted from
PHP's own command line, sapi/cli/php_cli.c, in the PHP source distribution
(https://github.com/php/php-src, PHP 8.5), under the PHP License, version
3.01, reproduced above. Cairo's changes are under Cairo's own license, the
Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE).

internal/core/fibers.c
----------------------

PHP before 8.4 has no zend_fiber_resume() and zend_fiber_suspend() for an
extension to call. On those versions cairo_fiber_resume() and
cairo_fiber_suspend() switch fibers with code adapted from Fiber::resume(),
Fiber::suspend() and the functions they call in Zend/zend_fibers.c of the PHP
source distribution (https://github.com/php/php-src, PHP 8.3), by Aaron
Piotrowski and Martin Schröder. That code is distributed under the Zend
Engine License, version 2.00, reproduced below. Cairo's changes are under
Cairo's own license, the Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE).

